            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl mb-6">
              <span class="theme-text-gradient">
                Pedro Dalben
              </span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
              Desenvolvedor e arquiteto de software com mais de cinco anos de experiência, apaixonado por criar soluções tecnológicas que realmente fazem a diferença.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start">
              <a href="#contato" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg theme-gradient px-8 py-3 text-white font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-all theme-shadow theme-focus-ring">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"/>
